",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "alignment": "START",
                  "lineSpacing": 115,
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 7,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "avoidWidowAndOrphan": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 1387,
              "endIndex": 1592,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 1387,
                    "endIndex": 1592,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "We distinguish observations, staff accounts and our interpretations. Published sources provide context, and course concepts guide analysis. Demand descriptions reflect the interviewee’s retail experience.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "alignment": "START",
                  "lineSpacing": 115,
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 7,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "avoidWidowAndOrphan": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 1592,
              "endIndex": 1633,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 1592,
                    "endIndex": 1633,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "2.2 Tong Keow and its mixed retail model\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
                  "lineSpacing": 115,
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 10,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 6,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "keepLinesTogether": true,
                  "keepWithNext": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 1633,
              "endIndex": 1934,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 1633,
                    "endIndex": 1933,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Tong Keow’s profile describes a medicine hall founded in Toa Payoh in 1968 and now run by second-generation family owners. Promotional materials feature American ginseng, monk fruit, cooling teas, pills and plasters (Tong Keow Medical Hall, 2022; “Instagram Reel About Tong Keow Medical Hall,” n.d.).",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "startIndex": 1933,
                    "endIndex": 1934,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "alignment": "START",
                  "lineSpacing": 115,
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 7,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "avoidWidowAndOrphan": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 1934,
              "endIndex": 2166,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 1934,
                    "endIndex": 2166,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The company advertises registered-physician consultations, acupuncture and cupping for indigestion, colds and sprains (“Instagram Reel About Tong Keow Medical Hall,” n.d.). We did not verify these services or observe consultations.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "alignment": "START",
                  "lineSpacing": 115,
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 7,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "avoidWidowAndOrphan": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 2166,
              "endIndex": 2331,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 2166,
                    "endIndex": 2331,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Branded soup packs beside herbs, grains and foods connect the branch to the wider business and allow shoppers to encounter herbal products during grocery purchases.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "alignment": "START",
                  "lineSpacing": 115,
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 7,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "avoidWidowAndOrphan": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 2331,
              "endIndex": 2334,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 2331,
                    "endIndex": 2332,
                    "inlineObjectElement": {
                      "inlineObjectId": "kix.76qzu6jlbbws",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
