            {
              "startIndex": 2383,
              "endIndex": 2765,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 2383,
                    "endIndex": 2764,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Staff described mainly Chinese, middle-aged and older customers, including people in their forties and fifties. Hougang had 228,140 planning-area residents in June 2024; HDB reported 57,557 flats and 165,450 residents as of 31 March 2024. These totals cover different populations (Singapore Department of Statistics [DOS], 2024; Housing & Development Board [HDB], 2024, pp. 11–12).",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 11,
                          "unit": "PT"
